    "snippet": "- Isolated showers and storms will be possible over the higher terrain of eastern and southeastern AZ today and Thursday - Tropical moisture will arrive into the region late Thursday into Friday and persist through much of the weekend, resulting in a chance of heavy rainfall in some locations. Latest NBM PoPs are picking up on widely scattered shower and storm activity across southeastern AZ this afternoon, mainly in the TWC forecast area.",
